/T (The idea behind this plugin actually started from something simple: I really like the style of raster visualizations often seen in remote sensing papers, especially stretchbars with fully readable labels and cleaner scientific layouts instead of only showing minimum and maximum values. I always found those visualization styles more informative and aesthetically pleasing for scientific communication.)
